                  "type": "boolean",
                  "description": "If true, applicants who answer incorrectly are automatically disqualified."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "ai_scoring_criteria": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "AI scoring criteria for evaluating candidates against this job.\nDiff-replace by `id`: items with `id` update the matching existing\ncriterion (preserving identity), items without `id` create new\ncriteria, and existing criteria not referenced in the payload are\nremoved. Omit the field to leave existing criteria untouched. Pass\nan empty array to detach all criteria. Each item's order in the\narray becomes its `position`.\n",
